              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man eyero pi yedhi, ugambre kum musonge ma ni i Lebanon cil kum alagi m’utwi kum gang’kidi: eyero bende pi yedi, man pi winyo, man pi gin ma lak i ng’om, man pi rec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.33"
            ]
          }
        },
